# DrumMania 10th Mix (System 573, digital I/O board): the first boot. The 573 BIOS boots the
# runtime CD, which installs itself to the onboard flash with no inputs, then shows INFO 508
# (install done, power-cycle) by frame ~7800. Hashes the main RAM every frame and snapshots every
# 60 frames, to compare HIRAKU's 573 core with MAME through the install.
game drmn10m

hash ram  0x80000000 0x80400000   # 4 MiB main RAM (KSEG0)

from 0 every 60 snap
at 8400 quit
